<p>See the <a href=3D"https://developers.openai.com/codex/windows#windows-s=
andbox">Windows setup guide</a> for details.</p>
<p>When you run Linux in a containerized environment such as Docker, the sa=
ndbox may not work if the host or container configuration blocks the namesp=
ace, setuid <code>bwrap</code>, or <code>seccomp</code> operations that Cod=
ex needs.</p>
<p>In that case, configure your Docker container to provide the isolation y=
ou need, then run <code>codex</code> with <code>--sandbox danger-full-acces=
s</code> (or the <code>--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox</code> fl=
ag) inside the container.</p>
