<p>If your host cannot run the Linux sandbox directly, or if your organizat=
ion already standardizes on containerized development, run Codex with Dev C=
ontainers and let Docker provide the outer isolation boundary. This works w=
ith Visual Studio Code Dev Containers and compatible tools.</p>
<p>Use the <a href=3D"https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/.devcontain=
er">Codex secure devcontainer example</a> as a reference implementation. Th=
e example installs Codex, common development tools, <code>bubblewrap</code>=
, and firewall-based outbound controls.</p>
<div class=3D"not-prose [&amp;_a]:underline border-default border border-so=
lid rounded-lg p-2 py-4 pl-5 mt-4 first:mt-0 mb-4 text-sm"><div class=3D"fl=
